Third-party software
--------------------

Catch2 3
  Catch2 is used only to build and run this project's tests. It is not linked
  into or distributed with the linkerbot-comm runtime library.
  The CMake download fallback uses v3.8.1; Gitea CI currently uses v3.7.1.
  An installed Catch2 3 package may also be used.
  Catch2 is licensed under the Boost Software License 1.0.
  Source: https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2
  License: https://www.boost.org/LICENSE_1_0.txt

Optional vendor CAN FD library
------------------------------

The optional libcanbus.so / HCanbus.dll implementation is loaded dynamically
at runtime. The vendor binary is not included in this repository or installed
by this project's CMake rules. Users must obtain it separately and comply
with the vendor's applicable license and distribution terms.
